# Design System Enforcement

Canonical tokens live in `docs/design/*` and `app/.../ui/theme/`.

## Brand (app-wide)

| Token | Hex | Use |
|-------|-----|-----|
| Royal Indigo | `#1A237E` | Legacy brand / admin accents |
| Royal Indigo Light | `#3949AB` | Containers / gradients |
| Login Primary | `#1D45D9` | Premium auth / CTAs |
| Login Primary Light | `#2D5BFF` | Gradients |
| Success | `#4CAF50` | Valid / success |
| Warning | `#FF9800` | Maintenance / caution |
| Danger | `#F44336` | Errors |

Operator colors (bKash/Nagad/Rocket/Upay) only for gateway branding — never as global theme primary.

## Surfaces

- Light bg: soft off-white / cool grey-blue (`#F5F7FA`–`#EEF4FF` family).
- Dark bg: navy black (`#0B0E14`–`#0F172A`), surfaces `#131722`–`#1A2336`.
- Cards: white / dark surface with `8dp` elevation (or soft shadow), radius `24–28dp` for premium cards.

## Type scale (Compose)

Use Material 3 `Typography` + explicit sizes when needed: 11 / 12 / 13 / 14 / 16 / 22 / 28 sp. Title bold; body regular; captions medium. No random 15/17/19 sizes without reason.

## Spacing / radius / control sizes

- Spacing: 4-point grid.
- Radius: 12 (chips), 16–20 (inputs/buttons), 24–28 (cards), full (pills/avatars).
- Button height: 48–56dp. Input height: 56–60dp. Icon: 20/24/28. Avatar: 32/40/48/72.

## Motion

Enter: fade / slight slide-up. Press: scale ~0.96–0.98. Prefer `tween(200–400)` + Material easing.

When adding tokens, update `Color.kt` / `Theme.kt` / `docs/design/color-system.md` together.
